            Buy Latex-ite Airport Grade for a typical faded driveway: it is filled, polymer-modified, cleans up with water and is stocked almost everywhere. Black Jack Drive-Maxx 1000 gives the best-looking finish on smooth asphalt, Jetcoat Premium suits rough, weathered surfaces, and Henry or Gardner refresh a recently sealed drive for less. Expect any coat to last about two to three years, and fill cracks with Pli-Stix first.
          </p>

