          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Latex-ite Airport Grade is the pail to buy for most asphalt driveways: filled, polymer-modified, easy to work with and on sale nearly everywhere. Pay more for Black Jack Drive-Maxx 1000 when the surface is smooth and the finish matters, and pay less for Henry or Gardner when the driveway was sealed recently and only needs freshening up.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Prep counts for more than the brand. Get the surface fully clean, fill the cracks properly, lay two thin coats in warm, dry weather and keep cars off for two days. Repeat every two to three years rather than every year, and nearly any reputable sealer will keep a sound driveway looking good and doing its job.
          </p>
